<title>USA: A.P. Green unit completes lime plant buy.</title>
<headline>A.P. Green unit completes lime plant buy.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO, Mo. 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>APG Lime Corp, a subsidiary of A.P. Green Industries Inc, said Tuesday it completed the previously announced acquisition of Eastern Ridge Lime LP's limestone plant in Ripplemead, Va. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Paul Hummer, chairman of A.P. Green, said the transaction represents another step in the company's long-range strategy of increasing its lime business.</p>
<p>A.P. Green mines, processes, manufactures and distributed specialty minerals.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
